{"id":"en_he-left-canada-i-took-his-money","title":"He left Canada I took his money","titleEn":"He left Canada I took his money","description":"Ava is a successful entrepreneur who discovers that her husband Ethan has been deceiving her: the overseas work assignment he claimed was a lie, he was having an affair, and he was siphoning off her money. Working with her lawyer Nora and her assistant Maya, Ava gathers thorough evidence of both the infidelity and the financial fraud. She then takes legal steps to protect her company and property, severing all ties with Ethan, his relatives, and his mistress. Once the legal battles are settled, Ava takes her cold-chain business public on NASDAQ. She also finds a new partner, Julian, who values her independence and has no interest in her wealth, and through this she reclaims her sense of self.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-left-canada-i-took-his-money/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-left-canada-i-took-his-money/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Strong Female Lead","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqkg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_he-left-canada-i-took-his-money_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqkg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-left-canada-i-took-his-money_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqkg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-left-canada-i-took-his-money_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqkg/?pub=4occak",